  "method": "Raw HTTP/1.1 requests over a 127.0.0.1 TCP socket (script host-and-smoke/host_check.py; exact request lines are 'GET <path> HTTP/1.1' + one 'Host:' line per listed value + 'Connection: close'). 'Reached backend' is judged from backend access-log line growth: for :3000 /api/* a +1 line means the proxy reached the backend; for :8000 every request logs one line (access line or uvicorn 'Invalid HTTP request' warning).",
